        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(BURIED TAPES) is a collection of psychological horror stories recorded on VHS. Each story features paranormal incidents narrated from the perspective of the survivors of these supernatural encounters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The second episode of these tapes is completely free, more episodes will be coming soon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949750/extras/2a9e8111a9ec9ac53784ded0eb793dac.poster.avif?t=1761385534\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949750/extras/2a9e8111a9ec9ac53784ded0eb793dac.webm?t=1761385534\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949750/extras/2a9e8111a9ec9ac53784ded0eb793dac.mp4?t=1761385534\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >(BURIED TAPES) The Parking</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the second episode of BURIED TAPES you play as Monica Jones, a 23 year old in an underground parking garage in 1994.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You lost the car keys and want to find them to get back home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your skills to overcome obstacles, you'll have to be fast and make the right choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alone and without help. Can you survive?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PSX style graphics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >VHS aesthetic.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive experience.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949750/extras/acd5ba4d36584695a35dee59208631c4.poster.avif?t=1761385534\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949750/extras/acd5ba4d36584695a35dee59208631c4.webm?t=1761385534\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949750/extras/acd5ba4d36584695a35dee59208631c4.mp4?t=1761385534\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Walk and drive mode.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Duration: Short (10-15 minutes).</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
